+| 5 (notifications)      | reminder scanner (due-soon/imminent windows, dedup UNIQUE), bell + panel + page, email queue → SMTP **or** labeled dev outbox                                                                              | 11 tests incl. `.eml` content assertion; live dev-scan created 6+6                        |
